@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed LC-02 source, independent draft and publication model
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

class ProfileRevision {
 sourceRevision : RevisionId
}
class EvidenceAssociation {
 artifactReference : ArtifactId
}
class ResumeDraft {
 draftVersion : RevisionId
 selections / ordering / layout
 localOverrides / language
 sourceProvenance
}
class SourceComparison {
 exact source + draft versions
}
class PublicationRevision <<immutable>> {
 content / selection / language manifest
 exact artifact + layout identities
}
class PublicationPointer {
 currentRevision : PublicationId
}
ProfileRevision --> EvidenceAssociation : reusable meaning
ResumeDraft --> ProfileRevision : explicit provenance
SourceComparison --> ProfileRevision : compared source
SourceComparison --> ResumeDraft : compared draft
ResumeDraft --> PublicationRevision : separately confirmed snapshot
PublicationPointer --> PublicationRevision : current live identity
note bottom of ResumeDraft
 Source edits do not automatically apply.
 Selected apply preserves unrelated overrides.
end note
note bottom of PublicationRevision
 Sharing controls viewer access.
 Applications owns actual submitted history.
 Files protects exact artifact references.
end note
@enduml
